{"id":436,"path":"/grammar-points/b1-b2/would-rather-would-prefer/","parentId":332,"order":190,"section":"grammar-points","level":"b1-b2","depth":3,"title":"Would rather, would prefer: Expressing preference","seo":{"title":"Would rather, would prefer: Expressing preference - Test-English","description":"Learn how to express preference with 'would rather' and 'would prefer' in this B1+ grammar lesson with clear rules, charts and exercises.","image":"/media/uploads/B2.1_Would-rather_Would-prefer.png"},"modified":"2026-09-16T16:38:32","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose the correct option for each gap below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"49\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose the correct option to complete the sentences below.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"50\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h5>Fill in the gaps with <span class=\"highlighter\">ONE word</span>. In some sentences, there is a word in brackets that you will need to use.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"51\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h2><strong>Would rather, would prefer</strong>: Grammar chart</h2> <p><img src=\"/media/uploads/would-rather-sooner-prefer.new_.png\" alt=\"A grammar chart explaining the use of &quot;would rather,&quot; &quot;would sooner,&quot; &quot;would prefer,&quot; and &quot;prefer&quot; to express preference. It includes examples and usage rules for each term.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-39176\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h2>Would rather/would sooner</h2> <h4><strong>Would rather/sooner</strong> + infinitive …&nbsp;<strong>(than)</strong></h4> <p>We use <a href=\"/grammar-points/b1/would-rather-would-sooner/\"><strong>would rather/sooner</strong></a>&nbsp;+ infinitive (without <strong>to</strong>) to talk about preference. We can use it&nbsp;with&nbsp;<strong>than</strong>&nbsp;(+noun/infinitive) in affirmative sentences or with&nbsp;<strong>or&nbsp;</strong>in questions.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I<span><strong><i>‘d </i></strong></span><span><strong>rather/sooner</strong></span></em><em><span><strong>&nbsp;have</strong></span> tea, please.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><i>I<span><strong>‘d </strong></span></i><span><strong><i>rather/sooner</i>&nbsp;</strong></span><em><span><strong>have tea than</strong></span>&nbsp;drink that coffee.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><span><strong><em>Would you rather/sooner</em></strong></span><em><span>&nbsp;<strong>have</strong></span> tea <span><strong>or</strong></span> coffee?</em></li> </ul> <h4><strong>Would rather/sooner</strong> + subject + past simple</h4> <p>We can use&nbsp;<strong>would rather/sooner</strong>&nbsp;+ subject + <a href=\"/grammar-points/a2/past-simple-form-use/\">past simple</a> to refer to the present or future.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><i>We</i><span><strong><i>‘d rather/sooner</i>&nbsp;</strong><em><strong>she was</strong></em></span><em><span><strong>/were</strong></span>&nbsp;with us now.*</em></li> <li><i>She</i><span><strong><i>‘d rather/sooner</i>&nbsp;</strong></span><em><span><strong>I picked</strong></span> her up&nbsp;after lunch.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><span><em>Would you&nbsp;rather/sooner</em>&nbsp;</span><em><span><strong>we went</strong></span> by bus <span><strong>or</strong></span> by train?</em></li> </ul> <p>🔍 <strong>Note</strong> that we can use <strong>were</strong>&nbsp;instead of <strong>was</strong> with<strong> I</strong>/<strong>he/she&nbsp;</strong>after&nbsp;<strong>would rather + subject</strong>.</p> <h2>Prefer</h2> <h4><strong>(Would) prefer + to</strong> + infinitive … <strong>(rather than/instead of)</strong></h4> <p>We&nbsp;use<strong>&nbsp;prefer/would prefer</strong> + noun or&nbsp;<strong>to +&nbsp;</strong>infinitive to talk about <strong>specific preference</strong>, i.e. what we prefer on a specific occasion.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I <span><strong>would prefer to</strong> <strong>stay</strong></span> in a hotel near the airport.&nbsp;</em>(or&nbsp;<em>I would rather stay…</em>)</li> <li><em>Most clients <span><strong>prefer to have</strong></span> breakfast in their bedroom.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>We can use&nbsp;<strong>prefer/would prefer</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>with <strong>rather than&nbsp;</strong>or&nbsp;<strong>instead of</strong> to show the choices we have.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I <span><strong>would prefer to</strong>&nbsp;<strong>be</strong></span> too early<strong><span> rather than be</span>&nbsp;</strong>too late.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I&nbsp;<span><strong>prefer to go</strong></span> with Dad&nbsp;<span><strong>instead of staying</strong></span> here with Mum.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>❗ <strong>Note</strong> that we use <strong>rather than</strong> + infinitive without <strong>to</strong></p> <h4><strong>Prefer</strong> + <strong>-ing</strong> verb</h4> <p>We use <strong>prefer</strong> + noun or <strong>-ing</strong> verb to talk about <strong>general preference</strong>, i.e. what we prefer in general, on every occasion.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I love&nbsp;running, but he<span><strong> prefers cycling</strong></span>.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>We can use&nbsp;<strong>prefer&nbsp;</strong>with&nbsp;<strong>to</strong> to show the choices we have. The word <strong>to</strong> is a preposition here, so if we use a verb after <strong>to</strong>, it should take the <strong>-ing</strong> form.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>He prefers <span><strong>walking</strong> <strong>to</strong> <strong>cycling</strong></span>.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":49,"questions":[{"id":362,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I prefer brown sugar <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> white sugar.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["than","that","to"]}]},{"id":363,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I don't want to go out. I'd rather <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> home.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["stay","to stay","staying"]}]},{"id":364,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I like trekking in the mountains, but I prefer <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> on a sandy beach.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["to lying","lie","lying"]}]},{"id":365,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'd rather go in December <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> in May.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["than","that","to"]}]},{"id":366,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'd rather come with you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> here alone.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["than stay","than staying","to stay"]}]},{"id":367,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I prefer travelling by bus <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> by train.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["to travel","to travelling","rather than travel"]}]},{"id":368,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I usually have tea, but today I'd prefer <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> coffee, please.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["have","having","to have"]}]},{"id":369,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'd prefer to read for a while <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> TV.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["rather than watch","that watch","to watch"]}]},{"id":370,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'd rather you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> here with me and the kids.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["stayed","to stay","stay"]}]},{"id":371,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to stay in a hotel.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["would rather","would prefer","rather"]}]}]},{"id":50,"questions":[{"id":372,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I'd prefer to watch a movie _______ go to a concert.</div>","choices":[{"id":458,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>rather than</span>"},{"id":459,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>to</span>"},{"id":460,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>that</span>"},{"id":461,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>from</span>"}]},{"id":373,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>He'd prefer to keep his job _______ fired.</div>","choices":[{"id":462,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>to being</span>"},{"id":463,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>rather than being</span>"},{"id":464,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>before to be</span>"},{"id":465,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>rather than be</span>"}]},{"id":374,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I'd prefer ______ just a salad.</div>","choices":[{"id":466,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>have </span>"},{"id":467,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>having</span>"},{"id":468,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>to have</span>"},{"id":469,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>to having</span>"}]},{"id":375,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I'd prefer to walk rather than _______ by car.</div>","choices":[{"id":470,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>to go</span>"},{"id":471,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>go</span>"},{"id":472,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>going</span>"},{"id":473,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>to going</span>"}]},{"id":376,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I _______ become a pianist. </div>","choices":[{"id":474,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>'d rather</span>"},{"id":475,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>'d prefer</span>"},{"id":476,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>prefer</span>"},{"id":477,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>rather</span>"}]},{"id":377,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I _______ to go on a cruise.</div>","choices":[{"id":478,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>would rather</span>"},{"id":479,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>rather</span>"},{"id":480,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>would prefer to</span>"},{"id":481,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>'d prefer</span>"}]},{"id":378,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I prefer running _______ .</div>","choices":[{"id":482,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>rather than to swim</span>"},{"id":483,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>to swimming</span>"},{"id":484,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>than swimming</span>"},{"id":485,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>to swim</span>"}]},{"id":379,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>She'd prefer to work night shifts _______ work at weekends.</div>","choices":[{"id":486,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>that</span>"},{"id":487,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>than</span>"},{"id":488,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>to</span>"},{"id":489,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>rather than</span>"}]},{"id":380,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I'd rather she _______ something different.</div>","choices":[{"id":490,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>study</span>"},{"id":491,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>studied</span>"},{"id":492,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>to study</span>"},{"id":493,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>would study</span>"}]},{"id":381,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I _______ he didn't do it on his own.</div>","choices":[{"id":494,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>'d prefer</span>"},{"id":495,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>'d like</span>"},{"id":496,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>'d rather</span>"},{"id":497,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>prefer</span>"}]}]},{"id":51,"questions":[{"id":382,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She would <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to stay with me rather <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> stay in a hotel. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":383,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I would <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> talk to you in private.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":384,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>They prefer fishing <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> hunting.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":385,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> living in a small village to living in a big city.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":386,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'd prefer to travel to different countries <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> than travel to only one.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":387,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'd rather you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (talk) to him first.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":388,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Would you rather <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (finish) this later?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":389,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'd <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to drink water <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> than wine</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":390,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'd <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> you took her to the hospital.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":391,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I prefer sitting in the back to <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> (sit) in the front.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}